PushAllModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Appends all list elements to the accumulator with a push loop (linear, amortized O(1) per element). Blessed idiom instead of quadratic ListConcat accumulation in a loop (Revizor catalog P-001 pattern; the concat-accum audit check points here).
    Provides: PushAll(acc, xs) -> out. Returns the accumulator with all xs elements.
    DependsOn: none (leaf; Core.ListPush in a loop).
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir, modules/EmitDataSection/EmitDataSection.sir, modules/Flatten/Flatten.sir.
    Notes: created during the B1-hang hunt (quadratic concat-accum cost 10h instead of minutes); mini/alloc stay byte-stable after the replacement.
